{"id":65,"name":"At-Talaq","nameAr":"الطلاق","nameFr":"Le divorce","place":"madinah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"65:1","fr":"Ô Prophète ! Quand vous répudier les femmes, répudiez-les conformément à leur période d’attente prescrite ; et comptez la période ; et craignez Allah votre Seigneur. Ne les faîtes pas sortir de leurs maisons, et qu’elles n’en sortent pas, à moins qu’elles n’aient commis une turpitude prouvée. Telles sont les lois d’Allah. Quiconque cependant transgresse les lois d’Allah, se fait du tort à lui-même. Tu ne sais pas si d’ici là Allah ne suscitera pas quelque chose de nouveau !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/065001.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O","tr":"yāayyuhā","l":"أَيّ","r":"أيي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/065_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en":"Prophet","tr":"l-nabiyu","l":"نَبِيّ","r":"نبأ","p":"nom","a":"wbw/065_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"إِذَا","en":"When","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/065_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"طَلَّقْتُمُ","en":"you divorce","tr":"ṭallaqtumu","l":"طَلَّقَ","r":"طلق","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/065_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلنِّسَآءَ","en":"[the] women","tr":"l-nisāa","l":"نِساء","r":"نسو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/065_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"فَطَلِّقُوهُنَّ","en":"then divorce them","tr":"faṭalliqūhunna","l":"طَلَّقَ","r":"طلق","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/065_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"لِعِدَّتِهِنَّ","en":"for their waiting period","tr":"liʿiddatihinna","l":"عِدَّة","r":"عدد","p":"nom","a":"wbw/065_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"وَأَحْصُوا۟","en":"and keep count","tr":"wa-aḥṣū","l":"أَحْصَى","r":"حصي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/065_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْعِدَّةَ ۖ","en":"(of) the waiting period","tr":"l-ʿidata","l":"عِدَّة","r":"عدد","p":"particule","a":"wbw/065_001_009.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en":"and fear","tr":"wa-ittaqū","l":"اتَّقَى","r":"وقي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/065_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهَ","en":"Allah","tr":"l-laha","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/065_001_012.mp3"},{"t":"رَبَّكُمْ ۖ","en":"your Lord","tr":"rabbakum","l":"رَبّ","r"